Recommends: hunspell-dictionary,
Description: retype text typed in the wrong keyboard layout
 Pause retypes the end of what was typed in the wrong layout, Shift+Pause the
 selected text, choosing the layouts and the start of the mistyped part with
 hunspell dictionaries. For KDE Plasma 6 on Wayland, with any number of
 layouts. Shows the current layout in the system tray.
